<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="수집력 — 개인 유물 검색 & 아카이브"
    />
    <title>수집력 — 개인 유물 검색 & 아카이브</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gowun+Batang&family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#search" aria-label="수집력 처음으로">
        수집력<span>Collecting Archive</span>
      </a>

      <nav aria-label="보조 메뉴">
        <a href="#guide">이용 안내</a>
        <a href="#settings">설정</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section
        id="search-view"
        class="view is-active"
        aria-labelledby="search-heading"
      >
        <div class="hero">
          <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <div class="hero-content">
            <p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE COLLECTION RESEARCH</p>
            <h1 id="search-heading">수집력</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">개인 유물 검색 &amp; 아카이브</p>

            <div class="mode-search">
              <button
                class="mode-toggle"
                type="button"
                data-switch="archive"
                aria-label="아카이브로 이동"
                title="아카이브로 이동"
              >
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="5.8" />
                  <path d="m15.2 15.2 4.2 4.2" />
                </svg>
              </button>

              <span class="mode-label">SEARCH</span>

              <form id="external-search-form" class="search-box">
                <label class="sr-only" for="external-search">유물 검색</label>
                <input
                  id="external-search"
                  type="search"
                  placeholder="유물명, 시대, 재질, 기관명을 검색하세요"
                  autocomplete="off"
                />
                <button type="submit">검색</button>
              </form>
            </div>

            <p class="suggestions">
              <button type="button" data-term="청자">청자</button>
              <button type="button" data-term="불상">불상</button>
              <button type="button" data-term="도자기">도자기</button>
              <button type="button" data-term="고려">고려</button>
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="hero-caption">
            풍경 / 메트로폴리탄 미술관 · 공개 소장품 예시
          </p>
        </div>

        <section
          class="content-section results-section"
          aria-labelledby="results-heading"
        >
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC COLLECTIONS</p>
              <h2 id="results-heading">살펴보기</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="filters" aria-label="검색 기관 필터">
              <button class="filter is-selected" data-filter="all">전체</button>
              <button class="filter" data-filter="e-Museum">e-Museum</button>
              <button class="filter" data-filter="The Met">The Met</button>
              <button class="filter" data-filter="Tokyo National Museum">
                Tokyo National Museum
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p id="results-summary" class="results-summary">
            공개 소장품 예시 6점
          </p>

          <div id="external-results" class="artifact-grid"></div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section id="archive-view" class="view" aria-labelledby="archive-heading">
        <div class="archive-header">
          <div class="archive-art" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <div class="archive-hero-content">
            <p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL COLLECTION</p>
            <h1 id="archive-heading">나의 아카이브</h1>
            <p>내 소장품과 조사·참고자료를 한곳에서 기록합니다.</p>

            <div class="archive-mode-search">
              <button
                class="mode-toggle"
                type="button"
                data-switch="search"
                aria-label="검색으로 이동"
                title="검색으로 이동"
              >
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path
                    d="M7 8.5c0-2.6 2.1-4.5 5-4.5s5 1.9 5 4.5M5.5 19.5h13l-1.2-8H6.7l-1.2 8ZM9 11.5V9m6 2.5V9"
                  />
                </svg>
              </button>

              <span class="mode-label">ARCHIVE</span>

              <form id="archive-search-form" class="archive-search">
                <label class="sr-only" for="archive-search-input">
                  아카이브 검색
                </label>
                <input
                  id="archive-search-input"
                  type="search"
                  placeholder="제목, 태그, 시대, 재질, 메모 검색"
                />
                <button type="submit">검색</button>
              </form>
            </div>

            <p class="archive-actions">
              <button id="add-record" class="text-button" type="button">
                + 새 기록
              </button>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="content-section archive-content">
          <div class="archive-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="아카이브 분류">
            <button role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-archive-filter="all">
              전체 <span id="count-all">0</span>
            </button>
            <button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-archive-filter="owned">
              내 소장품 <span id="count-owned">0</span>
            </button>
            <button
              role="tab"
              aria-selected="false"
              data-archive-filter="reference"
            >
              조사·참고자료 <span id="count-reference">0</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <div id="archive-grid" class="archive-grid"></div>

          <div id="archive-empty" class="empty-state">
            <p class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST RECORD</p>
            <h2>아직 기록한 유물이 없습니다.</h2>
            <p>검색 결과를 아카이브에 기록하거나, 직접 사진과 정보를 추가해 보세요.</p>
            <button class="text-button" type="button" data-open-record>
              + 첫 기록 추가
            </button>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>수집력</span>
      <p>외부 자료는 각 소장 기관의 원문과 이용 조건을 따릅니다.</p>
      <a
        href="https://colbase.nich.go.jp/?locale=ko"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >
        디자인 참고: COLBASE
      </a>
    </footer>

    <dialog id="record-dialog">
      <form id="record-form" method="dialog">
        <div class="dialog-head">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">NEW RECORD</p>
            <h2>새 기록</h2>
          </div>
          <button class="icon-close" value="cancel" aria-label="닫기">×</button>
        </div>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>기록 종류</legend>
          <label><input type="radio" name="kind" value="owned" checked /> 내 소장품</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="kind" value="reference" /> 조사·참고자료</label>
        </fieldset>

        <label>이미지 <input id="image-input" type="file" accept="image/*" /></label>
        <label>유물명 <input name="title" required placeholder="예: 청자 상감운학문 매병" /></label>

        <div class="form-row">
          <label>시대 <input name="period" placeholder="예: 고려" /></label>
          <label>재질 <input name="material" placeholder="예: 청자" /></label>
        </div>

        <label>태그 <input name="tags" placeholder="쉼표로 구분" /></label>
        <label>원문 링크 <input name="sourceUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://" /></label>
        <label>메모 <textarea name="note" rows="3" placeholder="기록하고 싶은 내용을 적어주세요."></textarea></label>

        <div class="dialog-actions">
          <button value="cancel" type="button" class="muted" id="cancel-record">
            취소
          </button>
          <button type="submit">기록 저장</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </dialog>

    <script src="./app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
